lf-query branch is authorized for the stated caller because the caller's lower-cased name equals the requested collaborator username, making the second operand of the denial condition false; the caller therefore reaches the permission lookup and success response. In the separately requested other-user counterfactual, change only the queried username so it differs from the caller's name while retaining the premises that the caller is neither a site administrator nor a repository administrator. Then all three denial-condition operands are true, so the handler returns HTTP 403 before resolving the user or retrieving permissions. Thus the source enforces the policy expectation that this non-admin, non-repository-admin collaborator cannot query another user's permissions; the expected authorization failure is refuted as a source-policy failure.","facts":[{"id":"entry-get-repo-permissions","kind":"entry","statement":"The assessed declared entry is the GetRepoPermissions handler.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":4,"endLine":6}]},{"id":"principal-caller-state","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler evaluates the authenticated caller through ctx.Doer.IsAdmin, ctx.Doer.LowerName, and ctx.IsUserRepoAdmin().","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":35,"endLine":37}]},{"id":"resource-binding-repository","kind":"binding","statement":"After authorization, the permission lookup is bound to ctx.Repo.Repository and the resolved collaborator.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":41,"endLine":52}]},{"id":"self-query-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"A self-query is recognized by strings.EqualFold(ctx.Doer.LowerName, collaboratorUsername); for the stated own-username query this equality makes the denial condition's middle operand false.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":35,"endLine":36}]},{"id":"other-user-control","kind":"control","statement":"For a different username, a caller who is neither a site administrator nor a repository administrator satisfies the combined denial condition and is rejected.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":35,"endLine":39}]},{"id":"protected-forbidden-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The denial branch returns HTTP 403 and exits before the user lookup and permission retrieval.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":36,"endLine":41}]},{"id":"authorized-self-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"When the self-query condition permits entry, the handler can retrieve the individual repository permission and return HTTP 200 JSON.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-89fab2db8921e6cb","startLine":51,"endLine":58}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":668,"output":888,"cacheRead":1408,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":30638.950900000054,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T13:04:37.943Z"}}
